# The Sundered Reach — Ink and Vellum
; The travelling theme, plus this map's own word. `use:` is not decoration: it
; makes the base an INHERITED layer, which is what spec 08 §6 exempts from the
; dead-declaration lint — a shared theme deliberately styles words no single
; map uses, and selecting it directly reports every one of them.
kind: theme
use: ../ink-and-vellum.theme.cd

[theme]
; Its islands are the subject of the map, so they carry more ink than the main.
island : fill=#ded0ac
